ENGLISH

Bauta is free to download and use for personal use.

Without written permission from the creator you may not:
- redistribute the app, for example by uploading the installation file to other
  websites or app stores. Please share a link to the official page instead.
- modify, decompile or rebuild the app, or publish it under another name.
- sell the app or use it in a commercial service.

The app is provided as is, without warranty. It gives no medical advice and does not
replace healthcare.

The only official sources are https://kakelakel.github.io/bauta-app/ and
https://github.com/kakelakel/bauta-app/releases.

Parts covered by their own licenses and not by this text:
- the fonts in the fonts/ folder and in the app (SIL Open Font License 1.1, see fonts/OFL.txt)
- nutrition data from the Swedish Food Agency's food database (CC BY 4.0)
- open-source libraries used by the app, under their respective licenses

Contact: steadfasttheapp@gmail.com
